  description: '2+ monsters

    If you control this card that was Link Summoned
    using "Cyberse Wizard" as material (Quick Effect): You can target 1 monster your
    opponent controls; change its battle position, and if you do, negate its effects
    until the end of the turn. If this card is destroyed by battle, or if this card
    in its owner''s possession is destroyed by an opponent''s card effect: You can
    Special Summon 1 "Cyberse Wizard" from your hand, Deck, or GY. You can only use
    each effect of "Cyberse Enchanter" once per turn.'
